{"unit_id":"meowyuho__dsh-session-archive#caveat-1","repo":"meowyuho/dsh-session-archive","commit":"796f44e029941266c22d708470cffea1e7dff599","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-archive 使用本机 DSH_HOME（默认 ~/.dsh）中的会话日志和缓存；永久删除不可撤销，执行前需在确认卡片核对会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:306-318","client.js:723-754"]}
